{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/MeterTable\/reverse(within:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reverse"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"within"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"beatTimeRange"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SN","text":"ClosedRange"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8BeatTimeV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/BeatTime","text":"BeatTime"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"beatTimeRange","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The beat-time range to mirror the grid within.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The grid within the range — clipped to start no earlier than the first entry — is cut into"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pieces, one per bar (clipped to the range), each with its meter and the extras of the entry"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that governs it. The pieces are mirrored within the range, and the entries in it are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replaced by one at the start of each mirrored piece, leaving out any that would be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redundant. Then:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Leftover → pickup:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" if the range starts at time 0 and the first mirrored piece is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shorter than its bar, it becomes the pickup.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The grid after the range is kept:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" if the range’s upper bound wasn’t a barline, an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entry with the meter in effect there is inserted at it, and a restart at the first","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"barline after it, so that every later barline stays where it was. If it was a barline,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an entry with the meter in effect there is inserted at it, unless the reversed grid","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already has a barline there with that meter.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, bars of 3\/4 then 2\/4, reversed within 0…1 (the range ending 1\/4 into the 2\/4"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bar), give 2\/4 at 0 with a pickup of 1\/4, then 3\/4 from 1\/4."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reverses the grid of this meter table within a beat-time range, mirroring its bars as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"music in that range is mirrored."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormodel\/metertable\/reverse(within:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/MeterTable"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"reverse(within:)","extendedModule":"IvorModel","externalID":"s:9IvorModel10MeterTableV7reverse6withinySNy0A6Timing8BeatTimeVG_tF","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reverse"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"within"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SN","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ClosedRange"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8BeatTimeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BeatTime"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IvorModel"}]},"references":{"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/MeterTable":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MeterTable"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A beat-time table of meters: where each meter takes effect, and the pickup before the first"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"full bar.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/metertable","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MeterTable"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/MeterTable","title":"MeterTable"},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/MeterTable/reverse(within:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/metertable\/reverse(within:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/MeterTable\/reverse(within:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reverse","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"within","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ClosedRange","preciseIdentifier":"s:SN","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"BeatTime","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8BeatTimeV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">)","kind":"text"}],"title":"reverse(within:)","abstract":[{"text":"Reverses the grid of this meter table within a beat-time range, mirroring its bars as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"music in that range is mirrored.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://IvorTiming/documentation/IvorTiming/BeatTime":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A point in musical beat time, measured in whole notes from time zero."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/BeatTime","title":"BeatTime","url":"\/documentation\/ivortiming\/beattime","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BeatTime"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BeatTime"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel","abstract":[{"text":"A representation-agnostic musical composition model.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel","title":"IvorModel","role":"collection"}}}